{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:12 2026-05-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:12 2026-05-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:12 2026-05-06 HKT</p><img alt=\"「機械騎士」今季首捷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/088e1b835697998a2bd62b868bfef185/2026-05/r2_0.jpg\"/><p>今晚沙田全泥宴第二場五班千二米，黃寶妮策騎的「機械騎士」擊敗大熱門「爆熱」取得今季首捷。</p><p>賽後練馬師文家良說：「『機械騎士』年紀增長，現時在四班沒有多大優勢，今場在五班上陣，回復競爭力。女見習騎師黃寶妮今仗跑得非常聰明，『辣得金』在『機械騎士』前面，黃寶妮頂住「辣得金」，令『機械騎士』不用擺前走耗費太多體力，更容易守到好位。『機械騎士』今仗排三檔有利，用黃寶妮可以減七磅也是主要爭勝關鍵。早前我特意黃寶妮策騎『機械騎士』出試泥地閘，讓她更熟悉此馬的性格，今仗發揮更能得心應手。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ec17680521a39f229276b98312e34f2d/2026-05/4b698652-c98c-47a3-8fa4-435a5ac86f4b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fa7577e72bdea041324575d59cf582ff/2026-05/6f634a96-7d6a-49f0-ab59-b8fcd277a1ca.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/493e8aadba0ddab9e443d023ddc520ff/2026-05/8fac2a9b-32e5-43cb-ad0a-6f13eed57ac2.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/386442ed22acceaaabd8e5c8ea6cfab9/2026-05/9b5feaa4-a171-4fb2-94fc-c24e46749211.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9d7ebdcd935fb34ef244458e408f760b/2026-05/25cc5f27-281b-46c3-908d-8663cb23ade8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f80b25d7f86e7962b606a346ffb161a7/2026-05/27b736ea-c64b-435b-8716-e8d651c1b204.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/695684fa2efb878bd02fcd48ea1f9344/2026-05/9911aa18-6375-4742-b72e-14b3dcd5fe06.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a5d5ede4296d48b30ea4392eb2e99db2/2026-05/ef1bc181-d447-4383-8661-ee48299c8556.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/805519d2bd0aac81b6c10509c2600e68/2026-05/f6eb3763-ff76-4a22-bcd2-4d35cc50e5b8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a5fc2ee8f714c9cd25a48daf97668a84/2026-05/f91b863f-8071-4b8b-ac51-6c68f3bf0aa5.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-06T12:45:04.655158+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}